# Algorithms tdns-signer links an implementation for.
#
# Currently the same selection as cmdv2/auth/algs.list. What matters is not
# that the two files match, but that this one covers every algorithm a DNSSEC
# policy on this deployment names: the signer is what actually produces the
# RRSIGs. A policy naming an algorithm this binary did not link quarantines
# the zone at load with that algorithm named, so the failure is localised and
# legible rather than silent.
#
# One registry NAME per line (see dnssec-algorithms/registry/registry.go).
# genalgs resolves each name to its codepoint, caps, package, and lib group,
# checks the lib is installed, and emits registered_algs.go + metadata_algs.go.
# Pure-Go (no lib needed):
MLDSA44
MLDSA65
MLDSA87
SLHDSA128S
# liboqs-backed:
FALCON512
FALCON1024
MAYO1
MAYO2
MAYO3
MAYO5
SNOVA24_5_4
SNOVA37_17_2
SNOVA25_8_3
CROSSRSDPG128SMALL
# SQIsign reference lib:
SQISIGN1
# QR-UOV reference lib:
QRUOV_Q31_L3
